 "notes": "Yamaha CP80 electric grand, forte layer (3rd of 4), mono, tone controls neutral, 22 notes D#1-B7 roughly every 3-4 semitones (one 8-semitone gap D#1-B1). Natural decay trimmed to 6 s (bass) .. 3 s (top). The original instrument used a 7 Hz tremolo; none is baked in. Recommended release 0.35-0.45 s.",
